Demo fixture for the pay stub images feature (derived from busy_joe).

Three W2 employers: Aramark, Target, Walmart.
  Employers WITH pay stub images: Aramark, Target
  Employers WITHOUT pay stub images: Walmart

Used to exercise the client income-report cover page, the caseworker
pay stub images file, and the paystub_images_included structured-output
field. See docs/manual-transmitter-testing.md and the Cbv::PreviewController.
